     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Please share profile on <a href style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ja...@nestarit.com</a>\r\n<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Direct contact number: <a href=\"tel:(201)%20448-1184\" value=\"+12014481184\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(201) 448 1184</a><span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Hi,<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">I have an urgent requirement with one of my Direct Client,\r\ndetails of which are given below. <span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Please send forward to me your most updated profile (resume)\r\nwith expected per hour rate ASAP.<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Please go through the below requirement and If you have\r\nsuitable candidate&#39;s kindly share updated resume along with below Contact \r\ndetails<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">I came\r\nacross your resume online while attempting to fill an opportunity for <b><span style=\"color:red\">UI Developer Node JS</span></b><span style=\"color:red\">. </span>This\r\nis a </span>Full Time <span lang=\"EN-IN\">opportunity\r\nwith our client.  I have attached the job descriptions below for your\r\nreview.  <span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><span> </span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"color:red;background:yellow\">**CANDIDATES MUST HAVE ALL THE REQUIRED SKILLS BELOW.**<span></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"color:red;background:yellow\">**MUST BE SR. 08-09+YEARS OF CANDIDATE…</span><span style=\"color:red\"> \r\nNO H1B &amp; EAD-OPT<span></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">We have a Requirement <b>UI Developer with Node JS</b>\r\nposition in<span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span><b>Hartford, <span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">CT. </span></b>If you have any matching resumes for the\r\nbelow mentioned position.<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Job Title: UI Developer Node JS <span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Location: Hartford, Connecticut<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Duration: 12 Months Contract<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Job Description: <span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">Mandatory Skills:<span></span></span></u></b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">5+ years of total\r\n     work experience with minimum 3 years as Node JS developer<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">In depth\r\n     knowledge of Node.js<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">Experience in\r\n     designing object oriented Javascript &amp; SVG<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">Code, test and\r\n     operate node.js based services <span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">Knowledge of\r\n     queuing and real-time Web services (REST or SOAP)<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">Experience in\r\n     working with Oracle DB as well as MongoDB databases<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">Experience in\r\n     working in Agile environments<span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">Secondary Skills: </span></u><span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>Applicable knowledge of web libraries and frameworks\r\n     such as Angular JS, HTML5, Express, REDIS<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>Familiarity with DevOps tools such as GitHub, Jenkins\r\n     etc<span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>Experience in developing operations support guides <span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Good\r\n     collaboration &amp; communication skills</span><u><span> <span></span></span></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u><span style=\"color:black\"><span><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span></span></span></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><u><span style=\"color:black\">Role &amp; Responsibilities:\r\n</span></u><span style=\"color:red\">(Pls. detail as much as possible)<span></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:red;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Design\r\n     &amp; development</span><span><span></span></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:red;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Work\r\n     across scrum teams to understand requirements &amp; deliver within the\r\n     agreed scope, timeline </span><span><span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Work directly with client architects &amp; developers to\r\ndesign &amp; develop robust system that seamlessly integrates with Informatica\r\nMDM &amp; Informatica<span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b> <span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">--------------------------------<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Thanks &amp; Regards,<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;f